---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Surat Thani to Khao Sok"
  description="Surat Thani to Khao Sok Discover more with our Khao Sok FAQs"
  heroImage="/images/khao-sok-hero-cottages.jpg"
  heroTitle="Surat Thani to Khao Sok"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Faq Category", "href": "/faq-category/"}, {"label": "Surat Thani Khao Sok", "href": "/faq-category/surat-thani-khao-sok/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Useful travel information for the journey from Surat Thani to Khao Sok. Also relevant details on the return.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What if my flight is late at night?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Shared vans from Surat Thani only run during the day up to around 16:00. For late flights, book a taxi (Surat Thani to Khao Sok only) or private transfer.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Can I get from Khao Sok to Surat Thani ferry piers?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes. Many shared vans continue on to Donsak Pier for ferries to Koh Samui, Koh Phangan, and Koh Tao.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How do I return from Khao Sok to Surat Thani Airport?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Book a shared van or private transfer directly from your guesthouse, resort or hotel. Shared vans are cheapest at around ฿300. Private transfers at ฿2000 are the fastest option. You will need to book a private transfer or taxi for early or late flights. There are no GRAB or similar taxi services available in Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What is the cheapest way from Surat Thani to Khao Sok?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The Phantip Travel shared van at ฿250–300 is the cheapest fare.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How long is the journey from Surat Thani to Khao Sok?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          By car or taxi ~1.5 hours. By shared van ~2.5 hours. By bus ~5 hours.
        </p>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
